{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46923","headline":"城中晚夏思山 · 齐己","name":"城中晚夏思山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"葛衣沾汗功虽健，纸扇摇风力甚卑。\n苦热恨无行脚处，微凉喜到立秋时。\n竹轩静看蜘蛛挂，莎径闲听蟋蟀移。\n天外有山归即是，岂同游子暮何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}